@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home Page";
}

<section class="hero">
   <h1 class="display-4">Welcome to Re-Waste</h1>
   <p class="lead">
        To find out how you can dispose of your device you can press the button below to begin our FREE
        experience. Learn the potential reselling opportunities, local donation options and much more ...
   </p>
   <a class="button button-large" asp-controller="Wizard" asp-action="Start">Check my phone</a>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>How it works in 3 steps</h2>

    <div class="options">
        <div class="option-card">
            <h3>1. Tell us about your phone</h3>
            <p>Answer a few questions about your phone's age and condition.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="option-card">
            <h3>2. Get your recommendations</h3>
            <p>
                Based on your answers, Re-Waste will suggest
                what you could do with your phone.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="option-card">
            <h3>3. Explore your options</h3>
            <p>
                Look at your results and see what options
                and nearby places are available.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<h2> Your options: </h2>
<section class="options">
    <div class="option-card">
        <h3>Repair it</h3>
        <p>
            If your phone still works but has a problem
            like a broken screen or battery, you could
            get it repaired.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="option-card">
        <h3>Resell it</h3>
        <p>
            If your phone is still in good condition
            but you don't need it anymore, you could sell it.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="option-card">
        <h3>Donate it</h3>
        <p>
            If your phone still works and you no longer
            use it, you could donate it so someone else can use it..
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="option-card">
        <h3>Recycle it</h3>
        <p>
            If your phone is too damaged to use or repair,
            recycling it could be a better option than
            throwing it away.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<p class="lead">
    Here at Re-Waste our goal is to get you to give your old tech a second life. Repair it, donate it, resell it or
    recycle it. Your old tech can be dealt with instead of sitting in your drawers. We will help you find out
    what you can do with your old tech, helping take some of the stress and confusion out of the process.
</p>


